            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>See what&#x27;s new in each Keel version: a What&#x27;s New button beside Install and Relaunch, a one-time card after Keel updates, and Help › What&#x27;s New in Keel.</li>
  <li>App Store updates open the app&#x27;s own App Store page, where the Update button works even before the Updates page lists it.</li>
  <li>Handing an update to the App Store no longer holds up Keel: the run finishes at once, and the row offers Open in App Store and Stop Waiting.</li>
  <li>With mas installed, App Store updates show what&#x27;s happening and the download size while they install.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
